WEBVTT

00:00:28.436 --> 00:00:30.556
for one reason or another,

00:00:30.596 --> 00:00:32.716
to another part of the country.

00:00:33.716 --> 00:00:37.076
My family was displaced
because of conflict,

00:00:37.116 --> 00:00:39.876
and I was born in a world
full of complexity,

00:00:39.916 --> 00:00:41.836
loss and deprivation.

00:00:41.876 --> 00:00:43.716
But despite that,

00:00:43.756 --> 00:00:45.636
my family and I are still here

00:00:45.676 --> 00:00:48.196
full of hopes and dreams
for a better tomorrow.

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:50.716
Before the camp,

00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:54.436
we used to live in a place
called Otash village in South Darfur.

00:00:54.476 --> 00:00:59.036
And as the word “otash” comes from
the Arabic word “A’atshan”,

00:00:59.076 --> 00:01:00.716
which means thirsty.